r than a weakening of it.\\n\\nNext step. Once the trusted runner executes this artifact and a correspondence review accepts it, it becomes the natural target for resolving the open issue: it is the C1 artifact that contains only in-scope predicates, so the resolution can state that the disputed property belongs to C3 while C1's own artifact set is clean. Audit spec version 6 stands, both other claims are untouched, and no requirement, premise or earlier observation was weakened.\"}"}}
